<title>USA: American Air expands Chicago cargo terminal.</title>
<headline>American Air expands Chicago cargo terminal.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Airlines will spend $2.8 million building a 7,800-square foot addition to its cargo terminal at Chicago's O'Hare International Airport.</p>
<p>The expansion, to be completed by October, will enable AA Cargo to unload four additional trucks at peak operating levels, the carrier said in a statement. - Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
</text>
